OL,5,G0135 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FToni gets her drug delivery, among
OL,7,     Ftins of fruit. Monica refuses
OL,8,     FToni's effort to recruit her as
OL,9,     Fmuscle, so she hires Martha. Jim
OL,10,     Fand Vera bond over a few drinks
OL,11,     Fand end up kissing.
OL,12,G0235 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FToni smuggles more contraband in,
OL,14,     Fand passes the dope around. Vera
OL,15,     Freports the drug taking to Erica.
OL,16,     FMonica tells Vera where the
OL,17,     Fcontraband is hidden.
